  "body": "Selling Well Below CV $830,000 - Sharply Priced at $768,000!\r\nVacant Possession - Ready to Move In!\r\nVendor Wants Action - All Offers Welcome!\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2023, this modern freehold home delivers easy coastal living in the heart of Browns Bay, just moments from the bus station, shops, and excellent local schools.\r\n\r\nProperty Documents (copy & paste the link below into your browser and scroll down):\r\nhttps://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG34276\r\n\r\nPositioned in an elevated setting, this well-designed home enjoys wide sea views, seamless indoor-outdoor flow to a private deck, and a practical layout tailored for easy, low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n- Zoned for Rangitoto College, Northcross Intermediate, and Sherwood Primary\r\n- Freehold title\r\n- 2-bedroom layout designed for easy everyday living\r\n- Sleek modern kitchen with quality branded appliances\r\n- Open-plan living flowing effortlessly to the deck\r\n- Double glazing with heat pump\r\n- Security alarm\r\n- Dedicated parking space x 1 \r\n- 10-Year Master Build Warranty\r\n- Residence Society levy approx. $2,106.30 p.a. including INSURANCE\r\n\r\nWithin the same development, we also have a 3-bedroom home available, offering one covered carport plus an additional dedicated parking space. Currently vacant and ready for immediate possession.\r\n\r\nConveniently located with easy access to the Northern Motorway and public transport, and only a short drive to Albany Mall, Park & Ride, Massey University, and leading private schools including Kristin and Pinehurst.\r\n\r\nSet within a boutique development, this home will appeal to first-home buyers, busy professionals, and investors seeking comfort, convenience, and a well-connected coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nModern, freehold, and positioned in sought-after Rangitoto College zone - this is an opportunity not to miss. Secure it today!",
